{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマスも終わって、\n東京の街並みはどうなっているんだろう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう一気に変わっているのかな？\n気づかないうちに、少しずつなのかもしれませんね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに私は、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだサンタさんのキーホルダー外せていないです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完全に外すタイミングを逃しました、笑\nきっとこのまま、しばらく付けていそうです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな最近の私ですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木メやのぎおびで何度も話しているのでもうお腹いっぱいの方もいるかもしれませんが、かき氷にハマっています🍧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれは、沼です！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "想像以上に美味しくて、\n一度ハマると抜け出せません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーー、食べたい！！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんもぜひ、冬のかき氷を口実に\n誰かを誘ってみてはいかがでしょうか^_^♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もね、かき氷行こ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってメンバーたくさん誘ってるんだ〜✌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遅くなりましたが、今日のお知らせはこれです！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob1FWY8r.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年11月25日から発売されています\nアップトゥボーイ vol.357✨✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表紙と巻頭20ページに登場させていただいております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミート＆グリートで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アップトゥボーイ買ったよー！\nここのページがお気に入りなんだよねー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とたくさん教えていただいて、それが嬉しくて嬉しくて、その日のうちに私もすぐアップトゥボーイ買いに行きました😆♡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobnu4FBG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob1gtWUw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影では、\n自分でも知らなかった表情や雰囲気を\nたくさん引き出していただいて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それを皆さんに届けられることが、\n本当に幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オフショットたくさん載っけとこ😆💕💕"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobcCHp6D.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobkdCfyq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日は、そんな皆んなと話せちゃうんです🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うれしーーーー！たのしーーみーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また色んなことを聞かせてください💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短めだったので、またすぐ書きますね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださり、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も１日お疲れさまです🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}